    //#region 🔖️op_text_binary_roundtrip_law
    /// 🧪️ F6: `OpText`/`OpBinary` round-trip laws for the hand-rolled `TiffMutation` grammar —
    /// exercises every variant incl. `SetTag`/`SetSnapshot`'s bare `TiffValues` payload across
